#: WhatsNext.gpr.py:52
msgid "What's Next"
msgstr "Nini elandi"

#: WhatsNext.gpr.py:53
msgid "Gramplet suggesting items to research"
msgstr "Gramplet oyo epesaka makanisi ya makambo ya koluka"

#: WhatsNext.gpr.py:66
msgid "What's Next?"
msgstr "Nini elandi?"

#: WhatsNext.py:129
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Lisalisi"

#: WhatsNext.py:206
msgid "People"
msgstr "Bato"

#: WhatsNext.py:210
msgid "Unknown first name"
msgstr "Nkombo ya yambo eyebani te"

#: WhatsNext.py:211
msgid "Report a person without a first name"
msgstr "Kolakisa moto oyo azali na nkombo ya yambo te"

#: WhatsNext.py:213
msgid "Unknown surname"
msgstr "Nkombo ya libota eyebani te"

#: WhatsNext.py:213
msgid "Report a person without a surname"
msgstr "Kolakisa moto oyo azali na nkombo ya libota te"

#: WhatsNext.py:216
msgid "Missing Birth event"
msgstr "Likambo ya Mbotama ezali te"

#: WhatsNext.py:217
msgid "Report a person without a Birth event"
msgstr "Kolakisa moto oyo azali na likambo ya Mbotama te"

#: WhatsNext.py:221
msgid "Birth date and place"
msgstr "Mokolo mpe esika ya mbotama"

#: WhatsNext.py:222
msgid "Check the date and place of the Birth event"
msgstr "Kotala mokolo mpe esika ya likambo ya Mbotama"

#: WhatsNext.py:226
msgid "Missing Death event"
msgstr "Likambo ya Liwa ezali te"

#: WhatsNext.py:228
msgid ""
"Report a person without a Death event, when Gramps judges from the dates of "
"the person and relatives that the person is no longer alive"
msgstr ""
"Kolakisa moto oyo azali na likambo ya Liwa te, ntango Gramps emoni na mikolo"
" ya moto yango mpe ya bandeko na ye ete azali lisusu na bomoi te"

#: WhatsNext.py:235
msgid "Death date and place"
msgstr "Mokolo mpe esika ya liwa"

#: WhatsNext.py:236
msgid "Check the date and place of the Death event"
msgstr "Kotala mokolo mpe esika ya likambo ya Liwa"

#: WhatsNext.py:241
msgid "Families"
msgstr "Mabota"

#: WhatsNext.py:245
msgid "Unknown relationship type"
msgstr "Lolenge ya boyokani eyebani te"

#: WhatsNext.py:246
msgid "Report a family with the relationship type \"Unknown\""
msgstr "Kolakisa libota oyo lolenge ya boyokani na yango ezali \"Eyebani te\""

#: WhatsNext.py:250
msgid "Missing Marriage event"
msgstr "Likambo ya Libala ezali te"

#: WhatsNext.py:251
msgid "Report a family of the \"Married\" type without a Marriage event"
msgstr "Kolakisa libota ya lolenge \"Babalani\" oyo ezali na likambo ya Libala te"

#: WhatsNext.py:255
msgid "Marriage date and place"
msgstr "Mokolo mpe esika ya libala"

#: WhatsNext.py:256
msgid "Check the date and place of the Marriage event"
msgstr "Kotala mokolo mpe esika ya likambo ya Libala"

#: WhatsNext.py:260
msgid "Divorce date and place"
msgstr "Mokolo mpe esika ya bokabwani"

#: WhatsNext.py:261
msgid "Check the date and place of the Divorce event"
msgstr "Kotala mokolo mpe esika ya likambo ya Bokabwani"

#: WhatsNext.py:266
msgid "Relationships"
msgstr "Boyokani"

#: WhatsNext.py:270
msgid "Missing parent family"
msgstr "Libota ya baboti ezali te"

#: WhatsNext.py:271
msgid "List each person who has no parent family"
msgstr "Kotya na liste moto nyonso oyo azali na libota ya baboti te"

#: WhatsNext.py:275
msgid "Missing partner"
msgstr "Molongani azali te"

#: WhatsNext.py:276
msgid "Report a family with only one partner"
msgstr "Kolakisa libota oyo ezali na molongani moko kaka"

#: WhatsNext.py:280
msgid "Missing father"
msgstr "Tata azali te"

#: WhatsNext.py:281
msgid "Report a person whose parent family has no father"
msgstr "Kolakisa moto oyo libota ya baboti na ye ezali na tata te"

#: WhatsNext.py:285
msgid "Missing mother"
msgstr "Mama azali te"

#: WhatsNext.py:286
msgid "Report a person whose parent family has no mother"
msgstr "Kolakisa moto oyo libota ya baboti na ye ezali na mama te"

#: WhatsNext.py:291
msgid "Events"
msgstr "Makambo"

#: WhatsNext.py:293
msgid "Unknown date"
msgstr "Mokolo eyebani te"

#: WhatsNext.py:293
msgid "Report an event without a date"
msgstr "Kolakisa likambo oyo ezali na mokolo te"

#: WhatsNext.py:296
msgid "Date is text only"
msgstr "Mokolo ezali kaka makomi"

#: WhatsNext.py:297
msgid "Report a date that Gramps could not read as a date"
msgstr "Kolakisa mokolo oyo Gramps akokaki kotánga lokola mokolo te"

#: WhatsNext.py:301
msgid "Inexact date"
msgstr "Mokolo ya sikisiki te"

#: WhatsNext.py:303
msgid ""
"Report a range, a span, or a date with \"before\", \"after\", \"about\", "
"\"estimated\" or \"calculated\""
msgstr ""
"Kolakisa eleko, ntango, to mokolo na \"liboso ya\", \"nsima ya\", \"pene "
"na\", \"ya kokanisa\" to \"ya kotánga\""

#: WhatsNext.py:309
msgid "Incomplete date"
msgstr "Mokolo ya kokoka te"

#: WhatsNext.py:310
msgid "Report a single date without its day or month"
msgstr "Kolakisa mokolo moko oyo ezali na mokolo ya sanza to sanza te"

#: WhatsNext.py:312
msgid "Unknown place"
msgstr "Esika eyebani te"

#: WhatsNext.py:312
msgid "Report an event without a place"
msgstr "Kolakisa likambo oyo ezali na esika te"

#: WhatsNext.py:330
msgid "Enter the missing name in the Edit Person dialog."
msgstr "Kotya nkombo oyo ezangi na lisanga ya Kobongisa Moto."

#: WhatsNext.py:331
msgid "Add via the Events tab of the Edit Person dialog."
msgstr "Kobakisa na lokasa ya Makambo na lisanga ya Kobongisa Moto."

#: WhatsNext.py:333
msgid ""
"Open the event on the Events tab of the Edit Person dialog, and complete its"
" date and place."
msgstr ""
"Fungola likambo na lokasa ya Makambo na lisanga ya Kobongisa Moto, mpe "
"tondisa mokolo mpe esika na yango."

#: WhatsNext.py:337
msgid ""
"Open the event on the Events tab of the Edit Family dialog, and complete its"
" date and place."
msgstr ""
"Fungola likambo na lokasa ya Makambo na lisanga ya Kobongisa Libota, mpe "
"tondisa mokolo mpe esika na yango."

#: WhatsNext.py:340
msgid "Add a Marriage event on the Events tab of the Edit Family dialog."
msgstr ""
"Bakisa likambo ya Libala na lokasa ya Makambo na lisanga ya Kobongisa "
"Libota."

#: WhatsNext.py:341
msgid "Choose the relationship \"Type\" in the Edit Family dialog."
msgstr "Pona \"Lolenge\" ya boyokani na lisanga ya Kobongisa Libota."

#: WhatsNext.py:342
msgid "Add the missing partner in the Edit Family dialog."
msgstr "Bakisa molongani oyo azangi na lisanga ya Kobongisa Libota."

#: WhatsNext.py:343
msgid "Add the father in the Edit Family dialog of the parent family."
msgstr "Bakisa tata na lisanga ya Kobongisa Libota ya libota ya baboti."

#: WhatsNext.py:344
msgid "Add the mother in the Edit Family dialog of the parent family."
msgstr "Bakisa mama na lisanga ya Kobongisa Libota ya libota ya baboti."

#: WhatsNext.py:346
msgid ""
"In the Relationships view, choose \"Add New Parents...\" or \"Add Existing "
"Parents...\" from the Edit menu."
msgstr ""
"Na lolenge ya kotala Boyokani, pona \"Bakisa Baboti ya sika...\" to \"Bakisa"
" Baboti oyo bazali...\" na menu ya Kobongisa."

#: WhatsNext.py:400
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Esilisami"

#: WhatsNext.py:402
msgid "Ignored"
msgstr "Etikami"

#: WhatsNext.py:404
msgid "Pruned"
msgstr "Ekatami"

#: WhatsNext.py:546
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ A local Genealogical Tree database has not yet been loaded.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ Base ya ba données ya Nzete ya libota ya esika oyo naino ezwami te.\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:548
msgid " 👣 Next Steps:\n"
msgstr " 👣 Matambe oyo elandi:\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:549
msgid "  •  From the \"Family Trees\" menu,"
msgstr "  •  Na menu \"Banzete ya Libota\","

#: WhatsNext.py:550
msgid " use the \"Manage Family Trees...\" option to"
msgstr " salela option \"Kobongisa Banzete ya Libota...\" mpo na"

#: WhatsNext.py:551
msgid " create a New (or to select an existing) Tree database.\n"
msgstr " kosala base ya ba données ya Nzete ya sika (to kopona oyo ezali).\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:552
msgid "  •  Click the \"Load Family Tree\" button to begin"
msgstr "  •  Finá bouton \"Kofungola Nzete ya Libota\" mpo na kobanda"

#: WhatsNext.py:553
msgid ""
" working with the selected genealogical tree.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" kosala na nzete ya libota oyo oponi.\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:556
msgid ""
"To use a backup from Gramps, or a GEDCOM file from another genealogical tool, choose \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Mpo na kosalela copie ya Gramps, to fichier GEDCOM ya esaleli mosusu ya libota, pona \"Kokotisa...\" na menu \"Banzete ya Libota\".\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:562
msgid ""
"To use a backup from Gramps, or a GEDCOM file from another genealogical tool, first create and load a new, empty tree. Then choose \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Mpo na kosalela copie ya Gramps, to fichier GEDCOM ya esaleli mosusu ya libota, salá liboso mpe fungolá nzete ya sika oyo ezali mpamba. Sima pona \"Kokotisa...\" na menu \"Banzete ya Libota\".\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:622
msgid "Use the \"Configure\" in the \"View\" menu to change the Gramplet options."
msgstr ""
"Salela \"Kobongisa\" na menu \"Kotala\" mpo na kobongola ba options ya "
"Gramplet."

#: WhatsNext.py:680 WhatsNext.py:1297
msgid "Organize Tags"
msgstr "Kobongisa bilembo"

#: WhatsNext.py:719
msgid "Complete"
msgstr "Kosilisa"

#: WhatsNext.py:720
msgid "Tag listed People and Families as Completed"
msgstr "Kotya elembo Esilisami na Bato mpe Mabota oyo bakomami"

#: WhatsNext.py:729
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Kotika"

#: WhatsNext.py:730
msgid "Tag to Ignore People and Families"
msgstr "Kotya elembo ya Kotika na Bato mpe Mabota"

#: WhatsNext.py:739
msgid "Prune"
msgstr "Kokata"

#: WhatsNext.py:741
msgid "Tag to Prune (exclude) listed People and Families from testing"
msgstr ""
"Kotya elembo ya Kokata (kolongola) Bato mpe Mabota oyo bakomami na komeka"

#: WhatsNext.py:820
msgid "Search Quota "
msgstr "Ndelo ya Boluki "

#: WhatsNext.py:824
msgid ""
"The least number of lines to show. The search stops once this many problems "
"are found"
msgstr ""
"Motango moke ya milongo ya kolakisa. Boluki etelemaka soki mikakatano mingi "
"boye emonani"

#: WhatsNext.py:832
msgid "Depth per loop"
msgstr "Bozindo na mbala moko"

#: WhatsNext.py:836
msgid ""
"How many generations of descendants to check before going up one more "
"generation of ancestors"
msgstr ""
"Mabota boni ya bakitani ya kotala liboso ya komata libota moko lisusu ya "
"bankoko"

#: WhatsNext.py:844
msgid "Pause search expansion"
msgstr "Kotelemisa mwa moke bokolisi ya boluki"

#: WhatsNext.py:848
msgid ""
"How many extra rounds to wait after checking an ancestor before checking the"
" descendants of that ancestor"
msgstr ""
"Mbala boni lisusu ya kozela nsima ya kotala nkoko liboso ya kotala bakitani "
"ya nkoko yango"

#: WhatsNext.py:856
msgid "Complete tag"
msgstr "Elembo Esilisami"

#: WhatsNext.py:857
msgid "Finished. Hide the object, and keep searching through it"
msgstr "Esili. Kobomba eloko, mpe kokoba koluka na kati na yango"

#: WhatsNext.py:862
msgid "Ignore tag"
msgstr "Elembo Kotika"

#: WhatsNext.py:864
msgid "Set aside for now. Hide the object, and keep searching through it"
msgstr ""
"Etikami pembeni mpo na sikawa. Kobomba eloko, mpe kokoba koluka na kati na "
"yango"

#: WhatsNext.py:870
msgid "Prune tag"
msgstr "Elembo Kokata"

#: WhatsNext.py:871
msgid "Dead end. Hide the object, and stop searching through it"
msgstr "Nzela ekangami. Kobomba eloko, mpe kotika koluka na kati na yango"

#: WhatsNext.py:888
msgid "Show suggested 👣 Next Steps"
msgstr "Kolakisa 👣 Matambe oyo elandi oyo epesami"

#: WhatsNext.py:891
msgid ""
"Show the guidance steps and the 👣 suggestions. Turn off for a shorter list"
msgstr ""
"Kolakisa matambe ya bokambi mpe 👣 makanisi. Kanga mpo na liste ya mokuse"

#: WhatsNext.py:1277
msgid "_Review (open editor)"
msgstr "_Kotala lisusu (kofungola mobongisi)"

#: WhatsNext.py:1287
msgid "Tag as Complete"
msgstr "Kotya elembo Esilisami"

#: WhatsNext.py:1288
msgid "Tag to Ignore"
msgstr "Kotya elembo ya Kotika"

#: WhatsNext.py:1289
msgid "Tag to Prune"
msgstr "Kotya elembo ya Kokata"

#: WhatsNext.py:1529
#, python-format
msgid "Tag as %s"
msgstr "Kotya elembo %s"

#: WhatsNext.py:1613
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ The current Tree database contains no people.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ Base ya ba données ya Nzete oyo ezali na bato te.\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:1616
msgid ""
"\n"
" 👣 Next Steps:\n"
" Add a Family and a person in that family:\n"
"  • A Family may be added via the \"Add\" menu\n"
"  • A person may be added by pressing the \"+\" (plus) in the spouse (\"Father/partner1\" or \"Mother/partner2\") panels or \"Children\" tab.\n"
"\n"
"Or Import People from an external file:\n"
"  • An external file may be used to populate the tree via \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu."
msgstr ""
"\n"
" 👣 Matambe oyo elandi:\n"
" Bakisa Libota mpe moto moko na libota yango:\n"
"  • Libota ekoki kobakisama na menu \"Bakisa\"\n"
"  • Moto akoki kobakisama na kofina \"+\" (bakisa) na ba panneaux ya balongani (\"Tata/molongani1\" to \"Mama/molongani2\") to na lokasa \"Bana\".\n"
"\n"
"To Kokotisa Bato uta na fichier ya libanda:\n"
"  • Fichier ya libanda ekoki kosalelama mpo na kotondisa nzete na nzela ya \"Kokotisa...\" na menu \"Banzete ya Libota\"."

#: WhatsNext.py:1632
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ No Person has been chosen as the focal \"Home Person\".\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ Moto moko te aponami lokola \"Moto ya Ndako\" ya katikati.\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:1635
msgid ""
"\n"
" 👣 Next Steps:\n"
"  •  Select the People view icon in the Navigator sidebar.\n"
"  •  Select someone to make them the \"Active Person\".\n"
"  •  Choose \"Set Home Person\" from the Edit menu or from the (right-click) context menu.\n"
"\n"
" This sets them as the focal \"Home Person\"."
msgstr ""
"\n"
" 👣 Matambe oyo elandi:\n"
"  •  Pona elilingi ya kotala Bato na barre ya pembeni ya Navigateur.\n"
"  •  Pona moto moko mpo azala \"Moto oyo azali kosala\".\n"
"  •  Pona \"Kotya Moto ya Ndako\" na menu ya Kobongisa to na menu ya contexte (kofina na loboko ya mobali).\n"
"\n"
" Yango ekotya ye lokola \"Moto ya Ndako\" ya katikati."

#: WhatsNext.py:1645
msgid "Double-click color text to edit details"
msgstr "Fina mbala mibale na makomi ya langi mpo na kobongisa makambo"

